<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Steinberg (1963, 1970) & Graner-Glazier (1992) differential adhesion cell sorting (Chick embryo (Gallus gallus) dissociated tissue aggregates & multicellular embryoid body spheroids)",
        "Steinberg (1963, 1970) & Graner-Glazier (1992) differential adhesion cell sorting faithfully reproduces Chick embryo (Gallus gallus) dissociated tissue aggregates & multicellular embryoid body spheroids morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 1964-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Chick embryo (Gallus gallus) dissociated tissue aggregates & multicellular embryoid body spheroids specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 90.7/100, audit 2026-10-19-differential-adhesion-sorting-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/1964-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting.py> ;
    schema:about "Chick embryo (Gallus gallus) dissociated tissue aggregates & multicellular embryoid body spheroids" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: Does not model active chemotaxis or subcellular cadherin trafficking kinetics.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: 2D extended Cellular Potts Model coupled with Detailed-Balance Kawasaki cell exchanges across all 5 thermodynamic regimes plus a 7-point continuous J_AB sweep.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Computer-vision segmentation of confocal fluorescence embryoid body spheroid (`cell_sorting_specimen.jpg`) comparing empirical GFP/RFP radial occupancy against Potts core-shell profiles (r = 0.9252, RMSE = 0.210).",
        "reported_in_source: Foty, Pfleger, Forgacs & Steinberg (1996) Development Table 1: empirical Gallus gallus tissue surface tensions (20.1 > 12.6 > 8.5 > 4.6 > 1.6 dyn/cm) strictly predict transitive mutual envelopment.",
        "reported_in_source: Graner & Glazier (1992) PRL Eqs. 1-3: extended Cellular Potts Hamiltonian with interfacial tensions gamma_AB = J_AB - (J_AA + J_BB)/2 and gamma_tauM = J_tauM - J_tautau/2 partitioning parameter space into checkerboard (gamma_AB < 0), complete engulfment (0 < gamma_AB < gamma_BM - gamma_AM), partial engulfment (gamma_AB > gamma_BM - gamma_AM > 0), and dissociation (gamma_AM < 0).",
        "reported_in_source: Steinberg (1963, 1970) Differential Adhesion Hypothesis (DAH): dissociated binary embryonic tissues spontaneously sort into concentric core-shell or lens configurations governed by interfacial free energy minimization.",
        "transfer_boundary: 2D lattice Cellular Potts representation of 3D multicellular spheroid cross-sections." ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/1964-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting.py; output: docs/media/differential_adhesion_sorting_comparison.png; organism: Chick embryo (Gallus gallus) dissociated tissue aggregates & multicellular embryoid body spheroids; checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/b9976f8; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 439c3a9015bc8fdc9014e2aa3a89cd71cffc876fcd81d0cb0b2f88bbf798d5a9; artifact_sha256: 755cf4ee94bc2b8c291aaf3de87bc50d9a6d08ca0c35af27bb8e340856cc1c90; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-differential-adhesion-sorting-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Steinberg (1963, 1970) Differential Adhesion Hypothesis (DAH): dissociated binary embryonic tissues spontaneously sort into concentric core-shell or lens configurations governed by interfacial free energy minimization. | Graner & Glazier (1992) PRL Eqs. 1-3: extended Cellular Potts Hamiltonian with interfacial tensions gamma_AB = J_AB - (J_AA + J_BB)/2 and gamma_tauM = J_tauM - J_tautau/2 partitioning parameter space into checkerboard (gamma_AB < 0), complete engulfment (0 < gamma_AB < gamma_BM - gamma_AM), partial engulfment (gamma_AB > gamma_BM - gamma_AM > 0), and dissociation (gamma_AM < 0). | Foty, Pfleger, Forgacs & Steinberg (1996) Development Table 1: empirical Gallus gallus tissue surface tensions (20.1 > 12.6 > 8.5 > 4.6 > 1.6 dyn/cm) strictly predict transitive mutual envelopment.; reconstructed_in_script: 2D extended Cellular Potts Model coupled with Detailed-Balance Kawasaki cell exchanges across all 5 thermodynamic regimes plus a 7-point continuous J_AB sweep. | Computer-vision segmentation of confocal fluorescence embryoid body spheroid (`cell_sorting_specimen.jpg`) comparing empirical GFP/RFP radial occupancy against Potts core-shell profiles (r = 0.9252, RMSE = 0.210).; transfer_boundary: 2D lattice Cellular Potts representation of 3D multicellular spheroid cross-sections.; does_not_claim: Does not model active chemotaxis or subcellular cadherin trafficking kinetics.]" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1002/jez.1401730406>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevE.47.2128>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.69.2013>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.141.3579.401>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.122.5.1611> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-model-fidelity>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-morphometric-validation>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-overall>,
