<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Steinberg (1963, 1970) & Graner-Glazier (1992) differential adhesion cell sorting — Model fidelity to source: 93/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Faithfully implements Steinberg's (1963) interfacial tension laws (`compute_interfacial_tensions`, L97-143) and Graner & Glazier's (1992) 2D extended Cellular Potts Hamiltonian (`simulate_potts_regime`, L244-445) across all 5 canonical regimes: complete engulfment (`0 < gamma_AB = 3 < gamma_BM - gamma_AM = 6`, yielding Δr = +0.3672 and L_AB/L = 0.1812), checkerboard mixing (`gamma_AB = -10 < 0`, L_AB/L = 0.724), partial engulfment (`gamma_AB = 8 > 6`, doublet lens with L_AB/L = 0.115), cell dissociation (`gamma_AM = -5 < 0`), and the equal-adhesion negative control (`gamma_AB = 0`, |Δr| = 0.017). Backed by 4 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.3e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-steinberg-differential-adhesion-sorting-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Steinberg (1963, 1970) & Graner-Glazier (1992) differential adhesion cell sorting — Morphometric validation: 89/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes 8 quantitative morphometrics in `measure_morphoeval()` (L877-944), including normalized radial core-shell separation Δr = (r_A - r_B)/R_agg, fractional heterotypic boundary length L_AB/L_total with logarithmic decay fit (`r = -0.8770, p < 1e-40`, Graner & Glazier 1992 Fig. 3), 12-annulus radial occupancy profile correlation against the segmented confocal specimen (`r = 0.9252`, `RMSE = 0.210`), and 100% concordance (10/10 binary tissue pairs, `r = 0.9959`) against Foty & Steinberg's (1996) empirical Gallus gallus surface tension hierarchy." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
